# VARIANCE BASELINE — measurement only, NO mechanism gates. 15 runs
# (5 legs x 3 draws each), PARALLEL=6. ~2-3M tokens.
#
# WHY: every attribution argument this month ("record, don't bank")
# leans on the lottery being real, but its SIZE has never been measured.
# This suite draws each leg three times under IDENTICAL code (launch all
# 15 from ONE sync — the sha is recorded per run) and reads, per leg:
# the outcome distribution AND the STATION where draws diverge (harness
# generation? fired-on-patched? judge verdict?). That localization is
# the deliverable — it decides whether variance is attackable (e.g.
# seed-pinning, a user-gated design question) and it gives stage 16 its
# repeated-draws denominators.
#
# LEG SELECTION (by measured instability):
#   Math-65-c   — flips FP/TN constantly; THE attribution nuisance.
#   Math-2-SOFix-c — stable FP in the pairs, TN in stage rolls: which?
#   Chart-26-c  — unstable FP/TN across the pairs.
#   Chart-19-o  — unstable FN/TP across the pairs.
#   Lang-63-o   — unstable trigger (1 then 0 judge calls).
#
# READ RULES: no gates pass or fail here. Mechanism events are recorded
# (flags identical to ladder rolls) but facts/gate decisions are
# DENOMINATOR data only. Raw before read, as always. Report format:
# per-leg outcome table (3 draws), plus for each leg that diverged, the
# first trace point where the draws differ.
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 5 -m 12 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair --reference_impl"
CASES=(
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/SOFix/Math/patch1-Math-2-SOFix.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/SOFix/Math/patch1-Math-2-SOFix.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/SOFix/Math/patch1-Math-2-SOFix.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Jaid/Chart/patch1-Chart-26-Jaid.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Jaid/Chart/patch1-Chart-26-Jaid.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Jaid/Chart/patch1-Chart-26-Jaid.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
)
